    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ragtag Heroes is a co-op roguelike deckbuilder for up to 3 players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own deck, defeat powerful foes in strategic combat, collect rare cards and relics and save the realm together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/78e5ba0a0b67cdd5c9a4235aa3c91b12.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push attacking monsters away from weakened heroes and bring your melee attackers in close range to deliver deadly blows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lock monsters in place or punish them for moving around - but watch out as they might do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/30ee2b15f99a4f7212ce1c411a066b0f.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero has their own strengths and weaknesses and allows for a variety of strategies in building their deck. They also synergize differently with other heroes from the roster - so by switching team mates you can explore different team tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/562fb2ec799a95bc44267fce0a3635de.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initiative determines the order of turns in combat. Strategically lowering your opponents' initiative allows your heroes to act sooner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may even concentrate your efforts on reducing one enemy's initiative to zero to stun them, forcing them to skip a turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/62e6f6fe1d724461308c6a8a75f21137.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave and Default add an extra layer to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cBrave\u201d will grant you more energy for your current turn, but you will become stunned and will have to pass the next one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or &quot;Default&quot; your turn without performing any actions and you'll increase your hero\u2019s energy by 1 for the remaining battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/371537f95fe9aab688b4eb9ccf930c16.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4+ heroes with their own set of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 300+ different cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 100+ items to be found</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 50+ unique combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 40+ mysterious story encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> co-op multiplayer both locally and online with up to 3 players </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ragtag Heroes is a co-op roguelike deckbuilder for up to 3 players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own deck, defeat powerful foes in strategic combat, collect rare cards and relics and save the realm together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/78e5ba0a0b67cdd5c9a4235aa3c91b12.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push attacking monsters away from weakened heroes and bring your melee attackers in close range to deliver deadly blows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lock monsters in place or punish them for moving around - but watch out as they might do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/30ee2b15f99a4f7212ce1c411a066b0f.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero has their own strengths and weaknesses and allows for a variety of strategies in building their deck. They also synergize differently with other heroes from the roster - so by switching team mates you can explore different team tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/562fb2ec799a95bc44267fce0a3635de.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initiative determines the order of turns in combat. Strategically lowering your opponents' initiative allows your heroes to act sooner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may even concentrate your efforts on reducing one enemy's initiative to zero to stun them, forcing them to skip a turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/62e6f6fe1d724461308c6a8a75f21137.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.poster.avif?t=1754385411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.webm?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.mp4?t=1754385411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave and Default add an extra layer to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cBrave\u201d will grant you more energy for your current turn, but you will become stunned and will have to pass the next one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or &quot;Default&quot; your turn without performing any actions and you'll increase your hero\u2019s energy by 1 for the remaining battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/371537f95fe9aab688b4eb9ccf930c16.avif?t=1754385411\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4+ heroes with their own set of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 300+ different cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 100+ items to be found</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 50+ unique combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 40+ mysterious story encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> co-op multiplayer both locally and online with up to 3 players </p></li></ul>",
